<tr><th>Purpose</th><td>Information</td><td>GDPR legal basis</td></tr>
<tr><th>Running, securing and fixing the site and API</th><td>Request data</td><td>Legitimate interests (keeping the Service working and safe)</td></tr>
<tr><th>Understanding traffic in aggregate</th><td>Request data, cookieless analytics</td><td>Legitimate interests</td></tr>
<tr><th>Selling and delivering products, receipts, support, refunds</th><td>Order and contact data</td><td>Performing our contract with you</td></tr>
